== access
summary "Manage browser access"
usage ""
args 0-0 id=false
run=false exitCodeFor=false inputExit=0
subs [show cloudflare github magic-link email oidc disable policy bindings users login-link sessions]
help exit 0:
Manage browser access

USAGE local-base access [OPTIONS] show|cloudflare|github|magic-link|email|oidc|disable|policy|bindings|users|login-link|sessions

OPTIONS

      --root=<path>    LocalBase data directory
  --non-interactive    Never open interactive prompts
             --json    Emit machine-readable JSON

COMMANDS

        show    Show browser identity provider configuration
  cloudflare    Configure Cloudflare Access browser authentication
      github    Manage GitHub OAuth registrations
  magic-link    Manage native magic-link authentication
       email    Manage email delivery
        oidc    Manage OpenID Connect registrations
     disable    Disable browser authentication
      policy    Manage browser authorization policy
    bindings    Name the sign-in provider on older email bindings and invitations
       users    Provision and manage browser users
  login-link    Print a one-time browser sign-in link for this computer
    sessions    List and end local browser sessions

Use local-base access <command> --help for more information about a command.

License: AGPL-3.0-or-later · Source: https://github.com/timsexperiments/LocalBase

